<span id="A1.T3.2.1.8.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">128,256 vocab, 3072-d, tied in/out</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.8.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
