<span id="A1.T3.2.1.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T3.2.1.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Long-context via KV optimization, tested up to <math id="A1.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>128K</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.9.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
<span id="A1.T3.2.1.9.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T3.2.1.9.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">128K tokens, efficient GQA</span>
</span></td>
